      en: ["The stadium was completed in 2009 at an estimated cost of 4.4 billion Rand.", "The exterior cladding consists of 37,000 square meters of glass fiber mesh.", "During the 2010 World Cup, its seating capacity was 64,100.", "The glass roof weighs 4,700 tons and was designed to provide natural light to the grass.", "It hosted the 2010 World Cup semi-final between Uruguay and the Netherlands.", "The stadium is the current home ground for the DHL Stormers rugby franchise."],
      es: ["Capacidad: 55.000 espectadores", "Periodo de construcción: 2007–2009", "Coste: 4.400 millones de rands", "Superficie del terreno: 16 hectáreas", "Techo de lámina ETFE", "Utilizado para 8 partidos de la Copa Mundial 2010"],
